Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.26,0:00:04.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.26,0:00:08.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说  天启就要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you saying that this is the...Apocalypse?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.75,0:00:10.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那这些具体的前兆  预示了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And these specific omens -- they're prelude to what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.89,0:00:11.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天启四骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Four Horsemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.06,0:00:13.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骑红马的是哪一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And which one rides the red horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.59,0:00:14.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}War.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.06,0:00:16.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这镇上肆虐的  是饥荒\N{\fnArial\fs30}This town is suffering from Famine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.44,0:00:18.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,饥荒骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-as in the Horseman?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.92,0:00:19.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.97,0:00:23.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死亡骑士要降临于世\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angel of death must be brought into this world
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.18,0:00:26.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必须经由残忍地屠杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}through a place of awful carnage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.91,0:00:29.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好啊  死亡骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.41,0:00:30.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  她是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.64,0:00:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.85,0:00:32.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世界末日就要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.14,0:00:35.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且如果我不阻止它并且救下所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I don't stop it and save everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.45,0:00:37.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就没有人能救我们了  我们都得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}then no one will, and we all die.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.35,0:00:41.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是太累了  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just tired, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.06,0:00:44.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我受够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.79,0:00:46.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的受够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am just done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.78,0:00:47.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.77,0:00:51.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.06,0:01:04.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(克莱·詹姆斯·汤姆森之墓)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.76,0:01:21.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,热带草原上  角马正在休憩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here on the savanna, the wildebeest lounges,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.66,0:01:23.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慵懒而满足\N{\fnArial\fs30}lazy and self-content...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.45,0:01:25.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对从阴影中悄然靠近的凶猛肉食动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}And oblivious to the fierce predator
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:26.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丝毫没有察觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}that stalks him from the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.74,0:01:29.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,庞大的角马群向南迁徙  寻找水源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great wildbeest herds migrate south, searching for water
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.59,0:01:33.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽可能多地饮水  为漫长旱季的来临做准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}drinking their field prepairation for the long dry season to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.06,0:01:36.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靠近兽群边缘的角马\N{\fnArial\fs30}... the wildbeests arround edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.93,0:01:39.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,惊怕每一丝风吹草动\N{\fnArial\fs30}every movement, every sound of potential attact.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:41.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灌木丛中的一阵轻响\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mere as a rush of wind in the bushes
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.64,0:01:44.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也能让整个角马群乱成一团\N{\fnArial\fs30}can send the entire herd into a bone-crashing snap.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.37,0:02:13.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始的时候角马会被迷惑  四散奔逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}At first the animal reacts with confusion, and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.58,0:02:30.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当疲惫的猎物再次回到饮水处\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the beast returns wearily to its watering hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.44,0:02:32.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,捕猎者已绕到它的背后\N{\fnArial\fs30}The killer's right behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.25,0:02:53.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它发起攻击之时  速度极快\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it attacks, it attacks quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.29,0:02:55.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.01,0:02:57.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你  上帝啊  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! God! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.46,0:03:08.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第5季第15集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.90,0:03:13.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  听着  收到留言回电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, listen, when you get this message, call!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.09,0:03:14.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.11,0:03:16.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还是不在家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he still not home?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.32,0:03:17.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他坐轮椅能走多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far could he get in that chair?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.50,0:03:24.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.68,0:03:31.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来  只能自己办了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...guess we just do it ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.17,0:03:36.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,韦尔斯先生  给我们讲讲事情经过吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Wells, why don't you tell us what you saw --
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.01,0:03:38.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用你自己的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}in your own words.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.13,0:03:39.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-叫我迪格(挖掘者)  - 迪格\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Call me Digger.  - Digger?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.00,0:03:42.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁给你取的这名字啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who -- who gave you that name?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.04,0:03:43.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.17,0:03:45.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自己给自己起别名\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gave yourself your own nickname?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.81,0:03:46.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不允许啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.84,0:03:48.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你管太宽了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who died and made you queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.35,0:03:52.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  还是讲讲你看到了什么吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Uh, why don't you just tell us what you saw?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.08,0:03:57.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看见克莱·汤姆森从窗户\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw Clay Thompson climb into Benny Sutton's trailer
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.60,0:03:58.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爬进了本尼·萨顿的房车\N{\fnArial\fs30}through the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.76,0:04:00.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几分钟以后  克莱走了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple minutes later, Clay walked out,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.28,0:04:02.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而本尼死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Benny's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.16,0:04:04.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.64,0:04:06.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看到的是这个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}...is this the guy you saw?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.39,0:04:09.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他当时浑身是泥  不过是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he was all covered with mud, but, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.66,0:04:10.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是克莱\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Clay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.19,0:04:13.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道克莱·汤姆森五年前就死了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are aware that Clay Thompson died five years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.25,0:04:15.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.66,0:04:18.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定你看到的是他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're positive that it was this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.07,0:04:20.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说我在撒谎吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You calling me a liar?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.47,0:04:21.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  当然没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.15,0:04:23.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.34,0:04:25.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能想到克莱·汤姆森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you think of any reason why Clay Thompson --
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.71,0:04:26.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不论他是死是活\N{\fnArial\fs30}alive or dead --
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.06,0:04:28.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么理由要杀本尼·萨顿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}would want to kill Benny Sutton?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.09,0:04:30.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.25,0:04:32.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, five years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.28,0:04:34.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正是本尼杀死了克莱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny's the one that killed Clay in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.75,0:04:36.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a fact?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.84,0:04:39.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是  所谓的"狩猎意外"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah, so-called "Hunting accident."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.26,0:04:40.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  要我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if you ask me...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.11,0:04:45.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是克莱从坟墓里爬出来报仇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clay came back from the grave to get a little payback.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.18,0:04:49.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.44,0:04:52.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欧文  把蛋糕放下  去拿个苹果吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Owen, put down the cupcake and pick up an apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.07,0:04:54.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.02,0:04:56.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖  我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.63,0:05:02.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,注意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heads up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.12,0:05:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,, 《冰血暴》\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Fargo."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.85,0:05:05.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Digger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.52,0:05:07.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,治安官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.31,0:05:09.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.34,0:05:10.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是乔迪·米尔斯治安官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sheriff Jody Mills.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.18,0:05:11.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我们没见过面吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe we've had the pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.65,0:05:13.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多尔夫曼和尼德梅尔探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agents Dorfman and Neidermeyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.71,0:05:14.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,联邦调查局\N{\fnArial\fs30}FBI
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.08,0:05:16.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生们  欢迎来到苏瀑镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Sux Falls, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.66,0:05:19.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以问问你们找迪格做什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I ask you what you're doing with Digger here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.13,0:05:21.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're doing their job.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.98,0:05:24.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们相信我  治安官\N{\fnArial\fs30}They believe me... sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.15,0:05:29.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,联调局相信死人会杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The FBI believes a dead man committed a murder?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.96,0:05:31.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,治安官  我们只是问几个问题而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we're just asking a few questions, sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.65,0:05:32.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.39,0:05:33.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果死人没杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, if a dead man didn't commit the murder,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.11,0:05:35.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是谁杀的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}then, uh, who did?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.21,0:05:39.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,二位来此有何公干\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you say your jurisdiction here was again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.26,0:05:39.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our jurisdiction is
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.95,0:05:41.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,执行联邦政府分派的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}wherever the United States government sends us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.35,0:05:44.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嘛  让我和你们的长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. How 'bout me and your supervisor
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.43,0:05:45.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谈谈如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}have a little chat about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.37,0:05:46.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.61,0:06:03.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是威利斯探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Willis speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.93,0:06:06.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,威利斯探员  我是乔迪·米尔斯治安官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Willis, this is sheriff Jody Mills --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.40,0:06:08.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.96,0:06:13.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.45,0:06:14.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是鲍比·辛格吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this Bobby Singer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.25,0:06:18.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我不认识您说的这个人  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I don't know who this is, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.38,0:06:20.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是联邦调查局的汤姆·威利斯探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is agent Tom Willis of the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.09,0:06:22.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扯淡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bull crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.21,0:06:25.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,联邦调查局是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}FBI, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.14,0:06:27.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  \N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.35,0:06:29.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来你认识鲍比·辛格\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you know Bobby Singer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.15,0:06:32.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这真是太巧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is...a fun coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.74,0:06:35.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对鲍比·辛格的印象就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's what I know about Bobby Singer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.83,0:06:37.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是个危险分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a menace around here --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.26,0:06:38.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个不守规矩的酒鬼大混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}ass-full of drunk-and-disorderlies
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.09,0:06:39.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还涉嫌邮件诈骗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and mail fraud.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.91,0:06:40.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understanding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.12,0:06:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一致认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we all can agree
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.04,0:06:44.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您已经讲得很清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've made yourself perfectly clear, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.01,0:06:46.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  无论你们三个在预谋什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, whatever the three of you are planning,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.12,0:06:50.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我马上停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}it ends here -- now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.76,0:06:52.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白了吗  探员们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten-four on that, agents?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.87,0:06:53.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.81,0:06:59.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我们打过多少次电话了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how many times we called?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.55,0:07:00.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到哪儿去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.18,0:07:02.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,练习轮椅杂技\N{\fnArial\fs30}Playing murderball.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.28,0:07:04.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这什么味道啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.28,0:07:06.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,香皂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that soap?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.31,0:07:07.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你打扫卫生来着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you clean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.09,0:07:08.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为你是我妈啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you, my mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.62,0:07:09.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要你管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bite me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.40,0:07:10.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  认真点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.59,0:07:11.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been working.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.82,0:07:13.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想办法阻止那个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, trying to find a way to stop the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.98,0:07:15.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-有进展吗  - 你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Find anything?  - What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.08,0:07:17.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, it's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.48,0:07:19.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's a case
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.08,0:07:22.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就发生在你家不到五英里的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}less than five miles from your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.45,0:07:24.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本尼·萨顿那案子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, the -- the Benny Sutton thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.24,0:07:25.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就为了这事儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what this is about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.46,0:07:26.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你老早就知道这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.29,0:07:28.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,废话  当然了  我早就做过调查了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, yes. I checked into it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.14,0:07:28.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么不正常的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.89,0:07:31.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有目击者看见一个死人杀了人还叫正常啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except a witness who saw a dead guy commit murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.47,0:07:33.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么目击者  迪格·韦尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}What witness? Digger Wells?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.14,0:07:34.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是他  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. So?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.60,0:07:35.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就是个酒鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, he's a drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.81,0:07:37.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那怎么解释那场雷雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what about the lightning storms?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.28,0:07:38.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个看似是恶鬼出现的前兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}They look like omens.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.22,0:07:39.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在二月这很常见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except in February
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.56,0:07:41.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,南达科塔正处在雷雨季\N{\fnArial\fs30}in South Dakota in storm season.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.60,0:07:45.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们  开始我也以为另有隐情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, I thought it was something, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.72,0:07:47.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时候事情就是这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes a cigar is just a cigar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.98,0:07:49.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那究竟谁杀了那家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}So who killed the guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.34,0:07:50.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁都可能啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.58,0:07:53.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本尼·萨顿已经混蛋到一定程度了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This Benny Sutton guy was a grade-a son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.75,0:07:55.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他这么混蛋不是一天两天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a list of the living a year long
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.67,0:07:57.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都想给他点颜色看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}wouldn't mind putting a cap in his ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.54,0:07:59.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是说你觉得这案子没什么异常\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're telling us... nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.41,0:08:01.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.63,0:08:03.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来你们这次是白来一趟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you wasted a tank of gas on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.42,0:08:05.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.71,0:08:20.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.81,0:08:23.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不就是那个墓地吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that the graveyard back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.38,0:08:27.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是又怎么了  鲍比早就查过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. So what? Bobby already checked it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.13,0:08:30.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那又怎样呢  鲍比就不会出错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And? What, Bobby's never wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.57,0:08:33.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们过去看一眼  然后就上路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. We'll take a peek, and then we'll hit the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.70,0:08:34.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么损失吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.74,0:08:49.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.03,0:08:55.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得这是新挖开的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That look fresh to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.44,0:08:56.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.98,0:09:23.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.55,0:09:27.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不好  但绝对不是什么好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, but something stinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.31,0:10:25.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别开枪  拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't shoot me! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.61,0:10:26.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钱都放在保险柜里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's money in the safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.90,0:10:27.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不稀罕你的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't want your money.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.19,0:10:29.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你们想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.30,0:10:30.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么都行  请别伤害我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything. Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.48,0:10:31.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是克莱·汤姆森  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Clay Thompson, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.43,0:10:35.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.51,0:10:38.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,联邦调查局\N{\fnArial\fs30}FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.80,0:10:39.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,联邦调查局\N{\fnArial\fs30}FBI?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.79,0:10:42.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  你们是为本尼那事来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god. This is about Benny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.87,0:10:43.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本尼怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wha-- what about Benny?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.92,0:10:45.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他杀了我  他在我背后开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed me! He shot me in the back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.48,0:10:47.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就不应该让他尝点苦头吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm supposed to let him get away with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.36,0:10:49.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你是在认罪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold up. Are -- are you confessing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.37,0:10:53.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托了  我会跟你们走  别吵醒我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. I'll go with you. Just -- just don't wake my kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.74,0:10:56.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你打算跟我们去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-you'll go with us where?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.45,0:10:57.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.53,0:10:59.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我先搞搞清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.93,0:11:04.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是克莱·汤姆森  五年前就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Clay Thompson, and you died five years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.20,0:11:05.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是的  - 三天前  \N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes.  - And three days ago 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.07,0:11:06.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你从坟墓里爬出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}you climbed out of your grave...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.24,0:11:07.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-杀了本尼·萨顿  - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you killed Benny Sutton?  - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.94,0:11:09.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那么其实你已经是死人了  - 差不多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So you are, in fact, a dead guy.  - I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.93,0:11:11.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也说不清我是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I-I don't know what I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.69,0:11:14.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克莱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.62,0:11:16.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我报警了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I called 911.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.65,0:11:18.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的别担心  这些人是联邦调查局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, honey. These men are the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.75,0:11:19.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是为了本尼的事来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're here about Benny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.00,0:11:21.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,汤姆森先生  你还是最好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you come with us, Mr. Thompson?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.18,0:11:22.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我们走一趟吧  \N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that'd be best.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.78,0:11:28.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.57,0:11:30.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.34,0:11:33.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就是个普通人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a soccer dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.38,0:11:34.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你想拿他怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want to do with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.66,0:11:36.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不许动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.51,0:11:38.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop your guns!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.00,0:11:42.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇  好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa. All right. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.89,0:11:45.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还记得你说的那个  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember the guy you said that was dead
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.49,0:11:47.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能杀人的死人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and couldn't possibly commit murder?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.84,0:11:49.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.65,0:11:51.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那又怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.95,0:11:54.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"那又怎样"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.79,0:11:56.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就请你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're welcome --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.27,0:11:58.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿下这个活生生的僵尸杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}for catching the undead killer zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.28,0:11:59.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管他是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever he is or isn't --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.83,0:12:00.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们都没有权利在大街上\N{\fnArial\fs30}that don't give you the right to shoot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.07,0:12:02.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-向他开枪  - 向我开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In the middle of the street.  - Shoot me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.12,0:12:04.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-汤姆森先生 你可以走了  - 放他走  \N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're free to go, Mr. Thompson  - Free to go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.96,0:12:06.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不敢相信你们要杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe you were gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.21,0:12:07.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你是个僵尸  - 我是纳税人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're a zombie!  - I'm a taxpayer!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.05,0:12:16.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么着  治安官受贿啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what? Sheriff's on the take?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.77,0:12:18.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.24,0:12:20.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,僵尸们向她行贿么\N{\fnArial\fs30}The zombies are paying her off?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.63,0:12:34.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们现在是朋友啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what? Now they're friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.73,0:12:40.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  那治安官不是讨厌你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, I thought the sheriff hated you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.98,0:12:43.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  直到5天前\N{\fnArial\fs30}She did till five days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.24,0:12:44.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,5天前发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened five days ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.50,0:12:46.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,镇子里的死人们都复活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dead started rising all over town.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.00,0:12:49.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你早就知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you knew about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.49,0:12:50.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.19,0:12:53.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想萨姆的意思是  你骗了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think what Sam meant to say is, you lied to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.07,0:12:59.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我告诉过你们这案子没什么异常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look -- I told you there was nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.86,0:13:01.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对你们而言就是没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there isn't. Not for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.59,0:13:05.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这儿可有僵尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are zombies here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.09,0:13:09.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,万物皆有其根源\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's zombies... and then there's zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.15,0:13:12.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.73,0:13:21.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能不能说清楚到底...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to tell us what the hell --
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.65,0:13:23.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.72,0:13:29.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没想到你会带朋友回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't realize you were bringing company.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.12,0:13:32.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝  现在是凌晨4点  你不用做饭的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 4 a.m., babe. You didn't need to cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.04,0:13:34.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再去拿些碟子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please I'll get some more plates.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.35,0:13:40.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.67,0:13:42.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯伦  我妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Karen. My wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.76,0:13:43.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你新找的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your new wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.88,0:13:47.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我死去的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dead wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.78,0:14:00.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,辛格夫人  这太美味了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is incredible, Mrs. Singer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.85,0:14:01.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.74,0:14:04.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咋啦  就是好吃呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.22,0:14:09.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好  凯伦  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's great, Karen. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.34,0:14:12.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能让我们单独呆一会么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you, um, just give us a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.48,0:14:25.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你疯了吗  到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you crazy? What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.27,0:14:26.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我可以解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I can explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.54,0:14:27.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解释什么  骗我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Explain what? Lying to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.32,0:14:30.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是那个美国僵尸女孩在你的厨房做蛋糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the American girl zombie making cupcakes in your kitchen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.92,0:14:33.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首先  那是我妻子  所以尊重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}First of all, that's my wife, so watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.52,0:14:36.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  不管那东西是什么  那不是你妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, whatever that thing is in there, it is not your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.48,0:14:37.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.55,0:14:38.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还用说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.49,0:14:40.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子  你觉得我是傻子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm an idiot, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.21,0:14:42.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我死去的妻子出现在我家门口\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dead wife shows up on my doorstep,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.41,0:14:44.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当然会尽我所学去测试她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna test her every way I ever learned?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.70,0:14:47.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那它是什么  僵尸  亡魂 \N{\fnArial\fs30}So what is it? Zombies? Revenant?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.68,0:14:48.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我哪知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell if I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.05,0:14:51.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她没有伤疤或是伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got no scars, no wounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.65,0:14:54.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对盐  银具和圣水都没反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}no reaction to salt, silver, holy water...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.69,0:14:56.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  她可是从棺材里爬出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, she crawled out of her coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.49,0:14:59.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  她没有  我把她火化的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she didn't. I cremated her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.54,0:15:03.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知怎么回事  她回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somehow, some way, she's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.59,0:15:04.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.78,0:15:05.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还用你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.70,0:15:06.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你埋葬了她的骨灰\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bury her ashes?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.67,0:15:07.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是的  - 埋哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah.  - Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.14,0:15:09.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在墓地\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the cemetery.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.99,0:15:11.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都是在那里复活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where they all rose from.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.74,0:15:14.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-多少个  - 15或者20个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How many? - 15, 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.86,0:15:16.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我列了张表\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made a list.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.84,0:15:19.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有凯伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, there's Karen...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.18,0:15:21.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克莱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clay...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.49,0:15:22.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米尔斯治安官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff Mills --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.04,0:15:24.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她儿子复活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}her little boy came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.17,0:15:27.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有任何迹象或是前兆吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there were no signs? No omens?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.94,0:15:30.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那时候下过雷雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there were the lightning storms.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.77,0:15:32.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们早说过了  还有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what we said. What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.26,0:15:46.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"火焰之中  一匹白马屹立于我面前"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And through the fire stood before me a pale horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.90,0:15:50.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"他坐在马背之上  手持镰刀"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And he that sat atop him carried a scythe,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.84,0:15:52.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"我目睹自他复活之后"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"and I saw since he had risen,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.10,0:15:54.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"他们也将复活"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"they, too, shall rise,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.03,0:15:57.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"自他而生  因他而生"\N{\fnArial\fs30}and from him and through him."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.94,0:16:04.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  是死亡骑士在作怪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, death is behind this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.60,0:16:09.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死亡骑士  那种拿着镰刀的骷髅死神吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deah, like "Grim Reaper" Death?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.44,0:16:10.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.56,0:16:13.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.80,0:16:15.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又一个天启骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another horseman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.37,0:16:16.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定是星期四\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be Thursday.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.90,0:16:20.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.41,0:16:23.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么死亡骑士要在苏福尔斯这种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would Death raise 15 people
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.59,0:16:25.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偏僻小镇复活15个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a podunk town like Sioux Falls?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.73,0:16:28.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.38,0:16:30.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果真是死亡骑士在作怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if death is behind this,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.89,0:16:32.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不论他的目的何在\N{\fnArial\fs30}then whatever these things are...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.28,0:16:34.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正肯定没好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.70,0:16:38.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要理解我们的职责所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what we have to do here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.43,0:16:42.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她什么都不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't remember anything, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.53,0:16:43.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.15,0:16:44.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不记得曾被恶魔附身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being possessed,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.43,0:16:46.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}me killing her...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.41,0:16:48.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后再复活\N{\fnArial\fs30}her coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.13,0:16:50.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.14,0:16:52.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别摆出这种表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, don't "Bobby" Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.34,0:16:54.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么都别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.56,0:16:58.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听听这声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}just listen, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.57,0:17:04.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她哼着歌做饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}She hums when she cooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.80,0:17:11.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前\N{\fnArial\fs30}She always...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.99,0:17:13.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她做饭时总是哼歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}used to hum when she cooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.15,0:17:17.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然跑调严重  但是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tone deaf as all hell, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.12,0:17:25.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没想过能再次听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I never thought I would hear it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.02,0:17:32.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,启示录上说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, just read revelation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.99,0:17:36.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死者会在天启时复活\N{\fnArial\fs30}The -- the dead rise during the apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.21,0:17:38.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这又不一定是坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing in there that says that's bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.15,0:17:40.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是因为当下形势如此糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, maybe it's the one good thing
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.75,0:17:42.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而唯独此事振奋人心  这不是很好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That comes out of this whole bloody mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.41,0:17:47.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换作你的话会怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what would you do if you were us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.19,0:18:00.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当然知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I'd do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.03,0:18:04.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也知道你们的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know what you think you got to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.45,0:18:06.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.82,0:18:08.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我求你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.09,0:18:10.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求求你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.37,0:18:13.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.15,0:18:16.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让她留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave her be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.48,0:18:23.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有何想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.62,0:18:25.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing to think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.98,0:18:26.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不会让鲍比独自在家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna leave Bobby at home
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.91,0:18:28.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和他的僵尸新娘共处一室\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the bride of Frankenstein.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.68,0:18:29.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你想怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.42,0:18:32.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样当着鲍比的面  爆头了她的头吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just walk in there in front of Bobby and blow her skull off?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.61,0:18:35.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是她想对鲍比下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she decides that Bobby's face
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.38,0:18:37.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老子还真干得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the blue plate special, I'd like to be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.10,0:18:40.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.79,0:18:42.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看还有什么线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}See what else we can find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.45,0:19:00.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我吓到你了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oops. Did I scare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.80,0:19:02.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.52,0:19:04.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没什么吓人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's...nothing scary about you at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.05,0:19:06.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想吃点午餐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel like some lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.63,0:19:09.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用了  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh...I'm good. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.40,0:19:10.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧  派还多着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come On. There's more pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.64,0:19:12.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得鲍比不想让我进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think that Bobby wants me inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.11,0:19:14.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就当是咱俩的秘密嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess it'll have to be our secret, then, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.19,0:19:16.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.83,0:19:53.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用说我也知道  你肯定超喜欢派\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go out on a limb and guess that you like pies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.55,0:19:54.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全是你烤的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you bake all these?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.95,0:19:55.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.65,0:19:57.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回来之后就一直烤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since I got back, I can't stop baking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.49,0:20:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你睡过觉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, when do you have time to sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.20,0:20:01.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.00,0:20:03.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定是太兴奋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be the excitement.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.02,0:20:05.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也可能是因为死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or being dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.65,0:20:12.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你不信任我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you don't trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.28,0:20:13.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.44,0:20:14.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,省省吧  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.91,0:20:16.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你才过来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you're here, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.98,0:20:19.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了监视我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keeping an eye on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.68,0:20:24.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.44,0:20:26.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也知道  鲍比变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like I know Bobby's not the same
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.03,0:20:29.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不再像我当初嫁给他那时  温和而唠叨\N{\fnArial\fs30}mild-mannered scrap dealer I married.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.54,0:20:32.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们猎鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hunt things.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.46,0:20:37.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我就是个鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I'm a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.23,0:20:39.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.47,0:20:41.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你也应该知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}So then you know that Sam and I
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.97,0:20:43.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和萨姆不会放任鲍比不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would never let anything happen to Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.90,0:20:45.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就像我们的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}That he's like a father to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.27,0:20:46.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.67,0:20:48.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有你们照顾他真好  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's lucky to have you looking out for him, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.71,0:20:49.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但不只有你们关心他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're not the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.21,0:20:53.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.87,0:20:59.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记得一清二楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I remember everything, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.59,0:21:02.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我死时的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I died.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.61,0:21:05.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那恶魔占了我的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}That demon taking over my body...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.78,0:21:08.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有在它控制下我的所作所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the things it made me do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.96,0:21:11.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比别无选择  只能...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Bobby having no choice but to...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.15,0:21:15.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也知道他做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.55,0:21:21.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我明白他的眼神\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can see it in his eyes when he looks at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.82,0:21:24.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,饱含内疚之情\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.43,0:21:26.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,折磨着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It weighs on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.15,0:21:28.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不告诉他真相呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why don't you just tell him you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.63,0:21:34.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用你说我也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go out on a limb here
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.22,0:21:36.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你从未有过真正的爱情\N{\fnArial\fs30}and say you've never been in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.69,0:21:39.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是我丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.52,0:21:41.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望他平静生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}My job is to bring him peace...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.04,0:21:44.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,远离痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.03,0:22:00.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琼斯太太在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Jones?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.00,0:22:18.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埃兹拉·琼斯?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ezra jones?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.18,0:22:41.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是埃兹拉·琼斯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um...Ezra jones?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.40,0:22:59.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.28,0:23:03.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就站在这儿  你说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think maybe you could tell me from here? 
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.54,0:23:08.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  肯定没啥好事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'm gonna regret this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.25,0:24:09.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小点声  凯伦在楼上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your damn voices down. Karen's upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.18,0:24:11.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  现在形势紧迫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sorry. We're a little tense right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.45,0:24:12.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琼斯老太太是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's old lady Jones?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.78,0:24:14.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-她第一个复活  - 所以也第一个露出真面目\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The first one to come up. - First one to go bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.14,0:24:17.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-她总是疯疯癫癫的  - 怎么个疯法\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ah, she was always a nutty broad. - Nutty how?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.86,0:24:19.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,疯到吃掉她老公的内脏吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nutty like the way she ate her husband's stomach?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.74,0:24:21.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她活着时不会这么疯狂吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that the level of nutty she was in life?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.41,0:24:23.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.12,0:24:26.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  我能理解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Bobby, I feel for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.40,0:24:27.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你必须认清\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you have got to acknowledge
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.60,0:24:29.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你被蒙蔽了双眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you're not exactly seeing this straight!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.65,0:24:30.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管你承认与否\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, whether you admit it or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.83,0:24:31.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些僵尸在变异\N{\fnArial\fs30}These things are turning.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.97,0:24:33.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得阻止他们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to stop them -- all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.20,0:24:42.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你们走吧  - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Time to go.  - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.18,0:24:44.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没听见吗  别管我的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard me. Off my property.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.31,0:24:47.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然呢  你就开枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what? You'll shoot?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.29,0:24:50.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果凯伦变异了  我自会处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Karen turns, I will handle it --
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.07,0:24:52.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}My way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.44,0:24:53.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.01,0:24:57.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会再说第二遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not telling you twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.73,0:25:18.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.89,0:25:19.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可是他妻子  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's his wife, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.04,0:25:21.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就和我们倒戈相向吗?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he goes "Full metal jacket" On us?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.34,0:25:22.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至于嘛  我们可是他的家人  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're his family, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.91,0:25:24.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  老哥  还有更要紧的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man. Bigger fish, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.74,0:25:25.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在有一大堆僵尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we got a bunch of zombies
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.57,0:25:27.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备把这镇上的活人都啃光呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}About to turn this town into a giant chew toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.76,0:25:28.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是  他和其中一个共处一室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and he's alone in the house
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.89,0:25:29.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢乐地做着点心派\N{\fnArial\fs30}making pie with one of 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.91,0:25:31.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那又怎样  - 你还问我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right? So?  - So!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.24,0:25:34.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna have to go back there
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.41,0:25:35.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And -- and -- and kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.37,0:25:37.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只能想到这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the only thing I can think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.65,0:25:39.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是让他看到  你就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he sees you, you're a dead man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.37,0:25:42.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就别让他看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, I guess I won't let him see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.89,0:25:44.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.13,0:25:47.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我去镇上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll...head to town
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.65,0:25:50.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把镇民救出来  应该不难\N{\fnArial\fs30}And rescue everyone -- should be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.84,0:25:51.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.66,0:25:53.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要些援助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.04,0:25:55.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,治安官怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the sheriff?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.36,0:25:56.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,按之前的经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, last time I checked,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.21,0:25:57.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那治安官还帮着僵尸呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sheriff was pretty pro-zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.58,0:25:59.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你得说服她咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess you'll just have to convince her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.47,0:26:01.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-怎么个说法   - 我咋知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How?  - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.35,0:26:02.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就去呗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just gonna.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.79,0:26:05.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好点了吗  宝贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. Does that feel better, honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.60,0:26:08.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很饿  妈咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so hungry, mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.13,0:26:11.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I know. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.94,0:26:15.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给你煮些汤吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy's gonna make you some soup, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.45,0:26:16.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.73,0:26:18.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道还能怎么说  大夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what else to tell you, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.92,0:26:20.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都量3次体温了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We checked the thermometer three times.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.13,0:26:23.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,体温是44°C\N{\fnArial\fs30}His temperature is 111 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.78,0:26:25.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-妈咪  - 等等  大夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mommy.  - Hold on, doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.28,0:26:27.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我饿  - 给他吃点这个吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm hungry!  - Can you take that in to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.90,0:26:33.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,德怀特医生  我是乔迪·米尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Dwight, it's Jody Mills.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.46,0:26:42.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯伦  别待在窗边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Karen, stay away from the windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.73,0:26:45.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Karen?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.08,0:26:50.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Karen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.18,0:26:56.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Karen?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.82,0:27:00.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我没事  - 还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm okay.  - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.92,0:27:01.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.09,0:27:02.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.70,0:27:04.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.62,0:27:08.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是有点头晕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I just got to be dizzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.55,0:27:12.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你发烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're burning up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.62,0:27:13.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.91,0:27:16.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得去找点吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I just need something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.47,0:27:18.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会没事的  真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll be fine. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.80,0:27:26.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道怎么解释  医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how to explain it, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.93,0:27:29.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们才找你  我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's -- that's why we're calling you. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.26,0:27:35.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sean?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.33,0:27:41.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欧文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Owen?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.33,0:27:57.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.00,0:28:18.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-快跑  - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go!  - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.71,0:28:19.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.12,0:28:23.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我丈夫  - 别管了  他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My husband!  - Leave it! He's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.10,0:28:25.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那不是我儿子  - 没错  他不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That was not my son!  - You're right. It wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.39,0:28:27.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  治安官  整个小镇危在旦夕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, sheriff. Your town is in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.50,0:28:28.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人都有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are in danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.52,0:28:29.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得救他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we need to help them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.22,0:28:31.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能帮我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you do that for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.65,0:28:33.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能集中注意力吗  治安官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you focus for me, sheriff?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.46,0:28:36.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,治安官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.56,0:28:40.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么收拾他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we put them down?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.10,0:28:41.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直接爆头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Head shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.69,0:28:51.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.53,0:28:54.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先四处去找人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can start by rounding up everybody we can find.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.77,0:28:56.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有安全的地方来安顿大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is there a safe place we can take people?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.93,0:28:58.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.84,0:29:01.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.00,0:29:05.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.91,0:29:08.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先等我一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.70,0:29:41.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很饿  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so hungry, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.67,0:29:44.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这就去给你煮点东西吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll fix you something to eat...in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.79,0:29:47.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能感觉到不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel it. It's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.80,0:29:50.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it gonna be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.18,0:29:52.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.03,0:29:54.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.87,0:29:56.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在变异  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm turning, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.68,0:29:58.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你心里清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.91,0:30:10.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.42,0:30:11.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-动手吧  - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do it.  - No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.84,0:30:13.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-求你了  - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please.  - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.38,0:30:20.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.48,0:30:24.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记得什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.90,0:30:26.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的遭遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.40,0:30:30.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被那个恶魔附身\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.65,0:30:31.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你亲手杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.27,0:30:34.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都历历在目\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.53,0:30:37.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你更应该明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.95,0:30:40.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种痛苦  我不想再经历一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why I can't do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.16,0:30:47.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还记得一些其他事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember something else, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.49,0:30:51.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我复活时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I came back...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.15,0:30:53.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到一个男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.98,0:30:56.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, a man?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.15,0:30:57.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在墓地那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.19,0:30:59.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是那么的削瘦\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was so thin.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.91,0:31:01.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简直是一具骨架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a skeleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.95,0:31:06.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他让我给你带句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he told me to give you a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.81,0:31:07.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.95,0:31:11.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不早点告诉我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-why didn't you tell me this before?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.98,0:31:15.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已不堪重负\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've seen so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.15,0:31:16.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.44,0:31:20.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想要你微笑依旧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to see you smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.35,0:31:24.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was the message?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.95,0:31:47.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.15,0:32:19.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各位  你们人手一枪  要是看见活死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, if I hand you a gun and you see a dead person,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.68,0:32:21.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不论他是你的朋友也好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care if it's your friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.18,0:32:23.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邻居或是你的妻子也罢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your neighbor, or your wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.79,0:32:25.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直接爆头\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shoot for the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.21,0:32:26.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有这样我们才能活命\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the only way we survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.65,0:32:29.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就不向大家自我介绍下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you mind telling us who the hell you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.65,0:32:31.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是鲍比·辛格的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friend of Bobby Singer's.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.08,0:32:32.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就那个市井醉汉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Town drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.68,0:32:35.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我以为...\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I-I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.03,0:32:38.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他现在戒掉了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was the town drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.71,0:32:39.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁说的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who told you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.21,0:32:42.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他自己...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby Singer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.81,0:32:46.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家提高警惕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.78,0:32:47.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我守着前门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll watch the front door.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.95,0:33:01.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  你要是不想来  我也理解...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Bobby, if you want to sit this one out...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.11,0:33:06.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,废话少说  要走快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.95,0:33:57.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.56,0:33:59.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.48,0:34:20.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.22,0:34:52.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.05,0:35:09.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搭把手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little help here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.31,0:35:19.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你还好吧  - 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's fine. - Yeah. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.99,0:35:40.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有弹药吗  我快空仓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got any more ammo? I'm low.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.29,0:35:41.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够用是够用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we got plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.39,0:35:42.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是得绕过那些僵尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just run back past the zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.92,0:35:44.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都留在那车里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in the van, where we left it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.39,0:35:45.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你直接说没有不就得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A simple "No" Would have been fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.69,0:35:47.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,僵尸们到底来这干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they all doing here, anyway?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.09,0:35:48.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我应该知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I get it. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.99,0:35:51.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that ain't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.55,0:36:00.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没子弹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.49,0:36:01.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我也是  - 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Me too. - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.20,0:36:30.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这群僵尸也太多了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kinda of a tightfit, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.49,0:36:31.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系  僵尸很蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. They're idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.72,0:36:32.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们可不会开锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't pick a lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.05,0:36:46.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这乌鸦嘴  说啥中啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you ever get tired of being wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.04,0:36:47.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这不也是为了回来帮你么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm making this stuff up as I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.55,0:36:48.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你抱怨个啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sue me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.09,0:37:01.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,低头  躲开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.22,0:37:35.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.13,0:37:59.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该没有漏网之鱼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if there's any zombies left out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.17,0:38:00.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们搜了个遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.00,0:38:03.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,镇民们怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are the townspeople?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.04,0:38:04.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被吓得不轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty freaked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.60,0:38:07.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还会留下心理创伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, traumatized.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.20,0:38:09.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人想告诉媒体\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few of them are calling the papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.20,0:38:12.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但目前为止还没人信\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as I can tell, nobody's believed 'em yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.48,0:38:14.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.00,0:38:18.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你心里好受点了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.55,0:38:31.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有僵尸都烧了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.60,0:38:35.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还差一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}All but one.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.34,0:39:01.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为我的不明之举\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, thinking maybe I should apologize
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.19,0:39:02.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我该向你们道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}for losing my head back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.24,0:39:03.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.22,0:39:07.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们之间不讲究这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't owe us anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.24,0:39:11.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我没啥资格谈论爱情  但是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look, I don't know squat from Shinola about love, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.80,0:39:15.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们至少共度了五天的美好时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least you got to spend five days with her, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.37,0:39:18.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.34,0:39:23.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但如此一来  我更加心如刀割\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which makes things about a thousand times worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.47,0:39:28.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是我一生的挚爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was the love of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.45,0:39:30.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但偏偏造化弄人  我还得经历多少次肺腑之痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times do I got to kill her?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.77,0:39:37.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  一切都会好起来  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna be okay, bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.50,0:39:45.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子们  凯伦告诉了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You boys should know...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.17,0:39:50.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死亡骑士出现的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}...Karen told me why death was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.94,0:39:51.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.34,0:39:54.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他去南达科他州的远郊墓地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know why he took a stroll through a cemetery
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.45,0:39:56.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可不是去随便闲逛的\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the sticks of South Dakota.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.50,0:39:59.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是冲着我来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He came for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.05,0:40:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.47,0:40:03.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死亡骑士冲我而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death came for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.10,0:40:07.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他让凯伦给我带个口信\N{\fnArial\fs30}He brought Karen back to send me a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.07,0:40:10.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You? Why you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.93,0:40:13.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我一直在帮你们两个小兔崽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I've been helping you, you sons of bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.80,0:40:16.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你坚持不肯答应路西法  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm one of the reasons you're still saying no to Lucifer, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.82,0:40:21.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以他想把你搞垮吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this was like a hit on your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.19,0:40:23.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  他们可能想要我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if they wanted to take my life or...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.58,0:40:25.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也可能是灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}My spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.50,0:40:29.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论怎样  他们要把我除掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way, they wanted me out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.94,0:40:32.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你很坚强  \N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.14,0:40:36.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一定能挺过去的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, Bobby?
